o Trail Longo de 38 km (2240m D+), o Trail Sprint de 18 km (1080m D+) e o Mini Trail \/ Caminhada de 11 km (685m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As provas pontuam para os circuitos nacionais de trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as dist\u00e2ncias competitivas integram os circuitos oficiais da ATRP e conferem pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para o \u00edndice de desempenho ITRA.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tipo de terreno e trilhos que vou encontrar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os percursos s\u00e3o compostos por single tracks de serra, caminhos florestais, linhas de \u00e1gua e cumeadas montanhosas com vista para o Rio Minho.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Stop and Go at\u00e9 ao encerramento dos prazos regulamentares.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Trail de Cerveira 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Terreiro \/ Centro Hist\u00f3rico de Vila Nova de Cerveira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Cerveira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viana do Castelo\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"EDV Viana Trail \/ XLIVE Events \/ Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Cerveira\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Ultra Trail de Cerveira 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 6 de setembro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 08:30 no Terreiro de Vila Nova de Cerveira.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza o Trail Longo de 38 km (2240m D+), o Trail Sprint de 18 km (1080m D+) e o Mini Trail \/ Caminhada de 11 km (685m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As provas pontuam para os circuitos nacionais de trail?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, as dist\u00e2ncias competitivas integram os circuitos oficiais da ATRP e conferem pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para o \u00edndice de desempenho ITRA.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tipo de terreno e trilhos que vou encontrar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type